00:03:49.050 --> 00:03:52.610
As if it weren't enough, she
was so much more than that.

00:03:52.610 --> 00:03:55.710
She was quite political while she was in.

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:58.133
And especially for a First Lady.

00:03:59.080 --> 00:04:02.860
She was running a command
center to get the equal rights

00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:05.600
