00:04:17.800 --> 00:04:19.690
You just couldn't shut her up.

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:21.660
- Yeah. But I love that.
she just spoke her truth.

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:25.780
- She came out and spoke
about her own breast cancer,

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:30.480
which raised awareness
and hundreds of thousands

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:31.680
of women then got screening.

00:04:31.680 --> 00:04:36.400
It was the number one killer
of women ages 40 to 45.

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:38.020
And nobody was talking about it.

00:04:38.020 --> 00:04:42.570
She talked about mental health,
her own issues with that.

00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:45.643
She was so open and honest with people.

00:04:46.545 --> 00:04:48.930
She was quite extraordinary.

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:50.500
