00:05:07.010 --> 00:05:08.090
It's such an important character.

00:05:08.090 --> 00:05:09.900
And I feel like, did you
know much about Betty Ford?

00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:11.470
I didn't know a ton about her

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:13.360
