00:05:16.660 --> 00:05:18.560
I knew about the treatment
center in the clinic.

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:23.143
I know people who have
gotten help at at her clinic.

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:25.770
And again, like you said,
if that wasn't enough

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:28.740
